"``cookie`` (insert, rewrite, prefix); stick tables (``stick on src``)"
msgstr ""
"``cookie`` (insert، rewrite، prefix)؛ وجداول stick (``stick on src``)"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:372
msgid ""
"A hash policy on the route with ring hash or Maglev; the stateful session "
